OL,3,ATen NHS staff removed over Noah Woods
OL,4,Adata breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen NHS staff have been removed from
OL,7,Fduty or suspended after a data breach
OL,8,Finvolving the medical records of
OL,9,Fthree-year-old Noah Woods.
OL,11,FLaunching an "urgent" investigation, Dr
OL,12,FMartin Mansfield, deputy chief medical
OL,13,Fofficer at East Suffolk and North Essex
OL,14,FNHS Foundation Trust, said that any
OL,15,Funauthorised access of patient data was
OL,16,F"completely unacceptable".
OL,18,FThe trust has apologised to Noah's
OL,19,Ffamily and said disciplinary action
OL,20,Fwould be taken if needed.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
